Short:    HydraBBS, Fantastic new BBS System (V1.10)
Uploader: dominicc@barrysworld.co.uk
Author:   dominicc@barrysworld.co.uk (Dominic Clifton - Hydra^cP!)
Type:     comm/bbs
Replaces: comm/bbs/Hydra17* comm/bbs/HydraBBSA8* comm/bbs/dat_h15* pix/illu/hbbs_pic.lha comm/bbs/HBBSDoorPack.lha comm/bbs/Hydra11*
Version:  1.10
Date:     15-August-1999
Requires: OS 2.04 or better
8.3 name: cP!-H110.LHA

  Introduction
  ============

    Quite simply, it's the best BBS system for scener's ever to hit the Amiga.

    Forget AmiExpress

    Forget FAME

    Forget SigmaExpress

    Forget DayDream

    Forget Tempest

    This rocks...

    It has all the best features of those, and a load more too!

  Installing
  ==========

    Read the docs!!!  I can't stress this enough!

    When you've run the installer script you *MUST* read the
    QuickStart section of HBBS.Guide.

    You can't possibly be thinking of running a BBS without having
    to read some docs, so just do it!  You'll thank me you did...

  Upgrading
  =========

    If you have an older version of HydraBBS V1 then you can just get the
    upgrades rather than downloading the whole archive.

  WebSite
  =======

    HydraBBS has it's own website, http://come.to/hydrabbs (or for
    those that like typing in long url's:
    Http://www.dsltd.force9.co.uk

    On it you can find the very latest information and upgrades
    as well as a Web Bases Support Forum where you can post and
    read messages from other HydraBBS users.

  Notification Mailing List
  =========================

    There is also a notification mailing list, if you want I can send you
    an e-mail when I release an upgrade.  To get added to the list send a
    blank e-mail with a subject of "HydraBBS ADD" to:

    HydraBBS@dsltd.force9.co.uk

